&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;. My name is &quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;slot&quot;,&quot;slot&quot;:&quot;name&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot; and you can reach me at &quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;slot&quot;,&quot;slot&quot;:&quot;email&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;.&quot;}],&quot;finePrint&quot;:&quot;The owner reads every offer and replies by email. Payment through Escrow.com.&quot;,&quot;turnstileTheme&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}"><form action="/api/offer" method="post"><p class="say"><span dir="auto">I&#x27;d like to buy example.com for </span><span class="slot"><label class="hit" for="amount" aria-hidden="true"></label>€<label class="sr-only" for="amount">Offer in euros</label><input inputMode="numeric" autoComplete="off" placeholder="your price" pattern="[0-9][0-9.,&#x27; ]*" id="amount" required="" size="10" enterKeyHint="next" aria-describedby="e-amount" name="amount"/><span class="tail">.</span><span class="sr-only" id="e-amount"></span></span><span dir="auto"> My name is </span><span class="slot"><label class="hit" for="name" aria-hidden="true"></label><label class="sr-only" for="name">Your name</label><input autoComplete="name" autoCapitalize="words" maxLength="100" placeholder="your name" spellCheck="false" id="name" required="" size="9" enterKeyHint="next" aria-describedby="e-name" name="name"/><span class="sr-only" id="e-name"></span></span><span dir="auto"> and you can reach me at </span><span class="slot"><label class="hit" for="email" aria-hidden="true"></label><label class="sr-only" for="email">Your email</label><input type="email" autoComplete="email" maxLength="200" placeholder="you@company.com" spellCheck="false" id="email" required="" size="15" enterKeyHint="send" aria-describedby="e-email" name="email"/><span class="tail">.</span><span class="sr-only" id="e-email"></span></span></p><input class="hp" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" aria-hidden="true" name="website"/><div class="row"><p class="fine" dir="auto">The owner reads every offer and replies by email. Payment through Escrow.com.</p><p class="tag" id="offer-error-amount">Offers start at €1,000. Raise yours to send it</p><p class="tag" id="offer-error-name">Add your name</p><p class="tag" id="offer-error-email">Add an email we can reply to</p><p class="tag" id="offer-error-check">Offers need JavaScript for the spam check. Turn it on and send again</p><p class="tag" id="offer-error-rate">Too many offers from here. Try again later</p><p class="tag" id="offer-error-failed">That didn&#x27;t go through. Try again in a minute</p><p class="tag" id="e-form" role="alert"></p><div class="cf-turnstile"></div><button class="send" type="submit"><span class="send-text" data-alt="Sending…"><span>Send offer</span></span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="sr-only" role="status"></span><noscript><p class="nojs" dir="auto">Offers need JavaScript for the spam check. <!-- -->Turn it on and reload this page to send yours.</p></noscript></div></form><div class="sent" id="offer-sent"><h2>Thanks. Your offer is with the owner.</h2><p>Next, the owner reads it. Any reply goes to the email you gave.</p></div><div class="sent" hidden="" tabindex="-1"></div></div></body></html>"
`;

